r making it through  the basic and advanced version of the  arena we get into probably the toughest  part of the game as now we have to  defeat jega the room is dark with tight  spaces and very little room to breathe  jega also uses an energy sword and  active camo making this fight incredibly  terrifying after defeating jega we walk  10 feet out of the room and get into  another boss fight with escheram who is  also insanely tough but of course he's  the master chief so he'll prevail and  rescue the pilot the three then go to  the silent auditorium to stop the  harbinger this journey also ties into a  discovery that the weapon is cortana yes  she dresses and sounds like her but it's  not a coincidence she is a literal copy  of her in halo 4 cortana talks about  being replaced with another ai after  she's dead possibly even one that looks  like her well they weren't kidding as  the weapon is literally cortana just  without the knowledge of their  adventures she's basically pre-halo 1  cortana who only knew of the chief's  existence and nothing else the weapon is  clearly worried is now that she realizes  she's a copy of cortana she's worried  that she'll go rampant too but that's  also another mission the master chief  was tasked with preventing her from  being another cortana continuing into  the silent auditorium we make it to  where cortana sacrificed herself and  then meet the harbinger according to the  harbinger the place we're stepping foot  in is where the forerunners pass  judgment on the harbinger in her kind it  seems that she has some hatred towards  the forerunners because of what they did  to her and the endless which is why  she's trying to revive them we do  eventually stop her but before she dies  she mentions that while her time is up  and that she's been defeated the chief  in the weapons time is up too as it  seems like she was able to contact the  endless before her death right after  this we get another echo of cortana but  this one's a little 